# Commit and push

This repo is the public copy of the final data models only.

When you change a model here, ask Khauram whether to commit and whether to push. After he says yes to both, commit and push to `origin` before the task is done. Follow `.cursor/rules/commit-messages.mdc`.

- Do not add working notes, ops scripts, credentials, or sample data.
- Message says why the model changed, in one or two sentences.
